    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those make sense. the audit rights seem especially important. is there anything else we should be looking out for? just more ways to catch people being sneaky or trying to disrupt things from the shadows? like, are there certain \"red flags\" in a contract that suggest a supplier might be one of those untrustworthy types?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
